{"4962490":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Old Money – Build Your Dynasty","steam_appid":4962490,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5002810],"detailed_description":"A fortune is built in one lifetime. A dynasty across generations.<br><br>Old Money is an elegant economic life sim: you start at 18 with almost empty pockets – and decide, month by month, how a first paycheck becomes an empire. And how much of it your heirs will carry on.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💼 Build your empire – across every asset class<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Run companies:<\/strong> staff, marketing, quality, five pricing strategies, research, holding supply chains and IPOs. Every company holds a real market share that competitors attack month after month.<br><\/li><li><strong>Stocks &amp; crypto:<\/strong> realistic prices, dividends, percentage trading – and yes: stocks and coins can crash completely.<br><\/li><li><strong>Real estate:<\/strong> buy, renovate, upgrade, develop plots – with tenants who have profiles of their own.<br><\/li><li><strong>Politics:<\/strong> build social influence and climb the ladder – from city council all the way to the top.<br><\/li><li><strong>Underworld:<\/strong> fast money in the shadows. But the heat rises – get caught and you lose part of your wealth and spend up to 24 months in jail.<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏆 Fight for the top spot<\/h2>Rival moguls are not set dressing: they snatch acquisition targets from under you and drive prices up in bidding wars. In return, you can launch hostile takeovers of smaller rivals and swallow their empires. The national rich list is a real race.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👑 Family, inheritance, dynasty<\/h2>Your partner has a career and wealth of their own. Your children are born with traits and talents and can later join the family business. You retire at 65; by 80 at the latest, your life ends – then the next generation inherits money, real estate and luxury goods, and you play on as your child. In the end, the <strong>dynasty grade (F to S)<\/strong> sums up your life's work in a single mark.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎲 Every decision carries weight<\/h2>Economic cycles, progressive taxes and inflation. Events with real choices instead of pure randomness. Insurance, health, your credit rating at the bank – and the yearly OLD MONEY GAZETTE, whose outlook genuinely moves next year's market.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >♾️ Built to keep you playing<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Permanent meta progression: achievements unlock starting bonuses and new scenarios – across all save games<br><\/li><li>Prestige mode: start the endless dynasty in a harsher world<br><\/li><li>4 starting scenarios, 3 difficulty levels, 3 save slots, rare once-in-a-century opportunities<\/li><\/ul><br>Fully localized in English, German, Spanish, French, Brazilian Portuguese and Polish.<br><br><i>Early Access: the game is fully playable. During Early Access we refine balancing and content together with the community – the price will increase at the full 1.0 release.<\/i>","about_the_game":"A fortune is built in one lifetime. A dynasty across generations.<br><br>Old Money is an elegant economic life sim: you start at 18 with almost empty pockets – and decide, month by month, how a first paycheck becomes an empire. And how much of it your heirs will carry on.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💼 Build your empire – across every asset class<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Run companies:<\/strong> staff, marketing, quality, five pricing strategies, research, holding supply chains and IPOs. Every company holds a real market share that competitors attack month after month.<br><\/li><li><strong>Stocks &amp; crypto:<\/strong> realistic prices, dividends, percentage trading – and yes: stocks and coins can crash completely.<br><\/li><li><strong>Real estate:<\/strong> buy, renovate, upgrade, develop plots – with tenants who have profiles of their own.<br><\/li><li><strong>Politics:<\/strong> build social influence and climb the ladder – from city council all the way to the top.<br><\/li><li><strong>Underworld:<\/strong> fast money in the shadows. But the heat rises – get caught and you lose part of your wealth and spend up to 24 months in jail.<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏆 Fight for the top spot<\/h2>Rival moguls are not set dressing: they snatch acquisition targets from under you and drive prices up in bidding wars. In return, you can launch hostile takeovers of smaller rivals and swallow their empires. The national rich list is a real race.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👑 Family, inheritance, dynasty<\/h2>Your partner has a career and wealth of their own. Your children are born with traits and talents and can later join the family business. You retire at 65; by 80 at the latest, your life ends – then the next generation inherits money, real estate and luxury goods, and you play on as your child. In the end, the <strong>dynasty grade (F to S)<\/strong> sums up your life's work in a single mark.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎲 Every decision carries weight<\/h2>Economic cycles, progressive taxes and inflation. Events with real choices instead of pure randomness. Insurance, health, your credit rating at the bank – and the yearly OLD MONEY GAZETTE, whose outlook genuinely moves next year's market.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >♾️ Built to keep you playing<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Permanent meta progression: achievements unlock starting bonuses and new scenarios – across all save games<br><\/li><li>Prestige mode: start the endless dynasty in a harsher world<br><\/li><li>4 starting scenarios, 3 difficulty levels, 3 save slots, rare once-in-a-century opportunities<\/li><\/ul><br>Fully localized in English, German, Spanish, French, Brazilian Portuguese and Polish.<br><br><i>Early Access: the game is fully playable. During Early Access we refine balancing and content together with the community – the price will increase at the full 1.0 release.<\/i>","short_description":"Old Money is an elegant business &amp; life simulation: start from almost nothing, build business empires, play the markets, amass real estate, found a dynasty and rise all the way into politics. A whole life – your decisions, right down to the legacy you pass on.","supported_languages":"English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Polish","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4962490\/c427207c41bf68afbe3223275f8819031877c31e\/header.jpg?t=1793665276","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4962490\/474c82cb54543fb88da9ffbef58496fb5c0299ca\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793665276","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4962490\/474c82cb54543fb88da9ffbef58496fb5c0299ca\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793665276","website":"https:\/\/delta-games.de","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3-4000 series or AMD equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> DirectX 11 compatible GPU with 2 GB VRAM (e.g. Intel HD 4000 \/ NVIDIA GTX 660)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 \/ 11 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5 (8th gen) or AMD Ryzen 5<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 \/ AMD RX 580 with 4 GB VRAM<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 4 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["DeltaGames"],"publishers":["DeltaGames"],"demos":[{"appid":5002810,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"EUR","initial":999,"final":999,"discount_percent":0,"initial_formatted":"","final_formatted":"9,99€"},"packages":[1722063],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Old Money – Build Your Dynasty","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1722063,"percent_savings_text":" ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Old Money - 9,99€","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":999}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"4","description":"Casual"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"28","description":"Simulation"},{"id":"2","description":"Strategy"},{"id":"70","description":"Early Access"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4962490\/09a05b48496875bbe5ffedabea3f17ade99705a1\/ss_09a05b48496875bbe5ffedabea3f17ade99705a1.600x338.jpg?t=1793665276","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4962490\/09a05b48496875bbe5ffedabea3f17ade99705a1\/ss_09a05b48496875bbe5ffedabea3f17ade99705a1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793665276"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4962490\/aee23fc2aac366b513dbb6d0967ecaa20840e2a3\/ss_aee23fc2aac366b513dbb6d0967ecaa20840e2a3.600x338.jpg?t=1793665276","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4962490\/aee23fc2aac366b513dbb6d0967ecaa20840e2a3\/ss_aee23fc2aac366b513dbb6d0967ecaa20840e2a3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793665276"},{"id":2,"p